    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d885a70d7b73ee96a053c9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在『日本杯』上， \n红色梦想所取得的戏剧性胜利， \n简直可以说是让整个世界都焕然一新了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "826a5e613e9f87847d93d8773c4a4938b2f5b2f689ce4dd492c8f6433f5a7f10",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
