    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22dfedc7cd669624b45495a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后……连我所在的那个小小的世界，\n也随之改变了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08a5ef93ee8d30c15adaa690597f054d4353fc6fb010c4dd9d07472862a05789",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
