    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d5bb52f99a9fdc105e575f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "抓在手中！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad617170d1943e34565623f908cea6df21991bf2d37377fce29b04c60a5dd64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        6,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02740614d396f4ef91942e8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『日本杯』过去了一段时间后， \n我收到了一封信件。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c47e895aeb9a664fdd7f29854642bdce5681efd4a8a89cafff7392349d202484",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        60,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/60/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fc1eea853bbe105b8e66d10",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "里面装着的，是红色梦想所期盼的、 \n越过大洋所需的入场券。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd4b821675f46fe974b6b65afb29f3ecbfb6262635f54621e6a4baba8346666b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        61,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/61/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f97f281b9df64fe2f1cb7c72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5669d3e7108545129c3d7620",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "海外转队……是吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d108a69227bd4b8c1b2053adcf5365ffec86c976dfe5be6da54f7768c5507288",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46e13c53615036a078887998",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想的活跃得到了赏识， \n来自在世界各国都非常活跃的美国顶尖队伍， \n向她发来了转队的邀请。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2f31ff0e1c3c7567e280cb02e211b99a41d1d33e719ab0cd75da099d159774b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76475647f5b510f9567c02c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的她体内完全没有『红之楔』再度复发的 \n迹象，为了向着世界挑战， \n她的身体状态正切实地调整得越来越好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d88c32880931a3753e114f93b00c0affa7b40d96686130793080d6fe472198d5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9cbfdb1a5f016e76739b3e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（――为了梦想的，未来）",
      "source_fingerprint": "113dbe29850bb53c7c2a75fa293e45e70c48156a852550d5faef94612a2ae5e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d818619b765fc7fc7cc05af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从今往后――如果不仅要在『育马者杯』中崭\n露头角， 还要在世界各地拓展属于自己的舞台的\n话， 那么这份邀请，是无论如何都应该接受的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e023e2d42267f48fc4cc659b9b97b1b1fb72bfd6e2152734a0034ead291d02b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        65,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/65/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272ad1f5cd4aeb8b026ae957",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d2a9456428ad5a5e2fd353",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……即便如此。 \n您却依然露出了强忍悲伤的表情……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bd3f5bd13062862bd2ee9d356faa917f09d940a33636ea3afc97a80dbc59d58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        66,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/66/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8f46f370de30475fb323bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5591d743b41662911ad8c880",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请告诉我吧。 \n现在的您，究竟在为什么而忧虑呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "70259e1fedfc6784d40cf7e1222468ca5793e68332610ec2c375ce3a095a3898",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        67,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/67/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73cb2403353afef27f1ef0eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c02e9f14cf5102bf8dad5b9ac22e2cb990dd8825ff4f026fcd125168e56c3cab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fbbd894e6f28674c1a196f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是一副仿佛能将一切洞悉的…… \n温柔平和的、圣女的面容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "176b8549e499c9c95a378af2fbdf2f27f5dea019bdfff7a5a09745706a8d1dea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        68,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/68/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1e04877f246c3fb96af9fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那是因为在邀请的条件里，明确提到了在当地\n会由那边的专属训练员来接管她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e97639c3eafbe24a0ede75f5c7fad9da016fa367f13d0d2ad17ad9d678be6d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        69,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/69/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f255ce2ae10e94a268b7e1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4d3b00200e049fd54cef1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e1067c6b48c651b9774ebd4decbb97740199f94bcff8ada8757cc846e7867b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f356bf4a0fa44e2be58a29d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她所要踏足的那条道路……我想和她并肩同行）",
      "source_fingerprint": "902344ba8abd14057a5d25132518ae049fd029e9e6fd069f161a7fc2c28dc497",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e27c9860162a9641f00896",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果想要实现她的梦想、如果是真心为她着想\n的话。微笑着目送她离去才是正确的做法。\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f46d9671cabd13cb37164e19da29d6464dcc0627890fc989854625cd948ab0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        70,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/70/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b8dfb75bd1ae318c69e6b48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5e5d3c28f823c6d91bdf244",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "遥不可及的异世界……\n我并不会要求您『一同前往』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28c2d4dc892b0eb4110f7cf6ee97b0854a6d72b04f42faaf584fba130bb21bc8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        71,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/71/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69f6277c2fa1a26a6b9e358e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想",
      "source_fingerprint": "405c5a0b0ebadc3e73aa5cd38d97e1245d0918e4d04ce079a699041f7ad83372",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        72,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/72/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d24035b6f07b64722dee4a89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "待到那一天真正来临时，\n只求您能为我献上临别赠礼，送我起航就好。 ",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ec15473770210164fcace837c3a1f1109b6a00ab8cd3b562caf35f708a200a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1136/storytimeline_501136319.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        72,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/72/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f454521228aa494adca72167",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我所应该做的，是全力支持作为马娘的红色梦想。",
